# About

Surfaced is a blog about secure software development: finding vulnerabilities, fixing them, and building software that doesn't have them in the first place.

This site is served over both HTTPS and Gemini. The two versions have the same content.

=> https://surfaced.run/ surfaced.run over HTTPS
=> gemini://gemini.surfaced.run/ gemini.surfaced.run over Gemini

## Contact

To report a security issue with this site, see the security policy.

